    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "BBC News reports that Anthropic raised $81bn in a record-breaking stock market debut.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:cae7150e35ad"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "According to Wikipedia, Anthropic offered 980 million Class A shares at $83 a share, priced on November 18, 2026, with trading due to begin on November 19 on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the ticker ANT.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386699549:74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Anthropic, PBC is an American artificial intelligence public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco, California.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386699549:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Anthropic is headquartered in San Francisco, United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116758847:P159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Anthropic was founded in 2021 by Dario Amodei, Daniela Amodei and 4 others, and Dario Amodei leads it as chief executive.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116758847:P571",
        "wd:Q116758847:P112",
        "wd:Q116758847:P169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "In the two weeks to 19 November 2026, 365 Hacker News stories mentioned Anthropic.",
      "cites": [
        "hn:2026-11-19:Q116758847"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "BBC News headlined its report, “Anthropic raises $81bn in record-breaking stock market debut”.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:cae7150e35ad"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "France 24 took a similar angle, headlining “AI lab Anthropic sets stock market record with $81 billion IPO”.",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:d7818ee6ffea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:01:08Z",
      "text": "This explainer draws on BBC News and France 24, Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews, Wikidata and Hacker News, and each caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
      "cites": [
